# Unit20
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit20核心词汇

hide/haɪd/隐藏/The sun hid behind the clouds.
high/haɪ高的/The mountain is very high.
highlight/ˈhaɪlaɪt/亮点；强调/The report highlights the importance of education.
highly/ˈhaɪli/非常；高度地/She is a highly respected scientist.
hire/ˈhaɪər/雇用/The company plans to hire more staff.
history/ˈhɪstri/历史/He is a professor of history.
hit/hɪt/打；击中/The ball hit the window.
hold/hoʊld/拿着；容纳/Please hold the door open for me.
hole/hoʊl/洞/There is a hole in my sock.
holiday/ˈhɑːlədeɪ/假期/We spent the holiday at the beach.
holy/ˈhoʊli/神圣的/Jerusalem is a holy city.
home/hoʊm/家/I'm going home after work.
honest/ˈɑːnɪst/诚实的/He is an honest and trustworthy person.
honor/ˈɑːnər/荣誉/It's an honor to meet you.
hope/hoʊp/希望/I hope you have a wonderful day.
horizon/həˈraɪzn/地平线/The sun sank below the horizon.
horrible/ˈhɔːrəbl/可怕的/There was a horrible accident on the highway.
host/hoʊst/主人；主持/She was the host of the TV show.
hostile/ˈhɑːstl/敌意的/The enemy was hostile and aggressive.
hot/hɑːt/热的/The soup is too hot to eat.
hotel/hoʊtel/旅馆/We stayed at a five-star hotel.
hour/ˈaʊər/小时/She studies for three hours every day.
house/haʊs/房子/They bought a new house last year.
household/ˈhaʊshoʊld/家庭的/Household expenses have increased.
housing/ˈhaʊzɪŋ/住房/The city needs more affordable housing.
huge/hjuːdʒ/巨大的/The project requires a huge investment.
human/ˈhjuːmən/人类的/Human beings are social animals.
humble/ˈhʌmbl/谦虚的/Despite his success, he remains humble.
humor/ˈhjuːmər/幽默/He has a great sense of humor.
hunger/ˈhʌŋɡər/饥饿/Many people in the world suffer from hunger.
hunt/hʌnt/打猎；搜索/They went out to hunt for food.
hurry/ˈhɜːri/匆忙/Hurry up, or we'll be late.
hurt/hɜːrt/伤害/She hurt her leg while running.
husband/ˈhʌzbənd/丈夫/Her husband is a doctor.
idea/aɪˈdiːə/想法；主意/That's a great idea!
ideal/aɪˈdiːl/理想的/This is an ideal place for a vacation.
identify/aɪˈdentɪfaɪ/识别/Can you identify the man in the photo?
identity/aɪˈdentəti/身份/He refused to reveal his identity.
idle/ˈaɪdl/空闲的；懒散的/Don't sit idle; do something useful.
ignore/ɪɡˈnɔːr/忽视/You shouldn't ignore the warning signs.
illegal/ɪˈliːɡl/非法的/It is illegal to drive without a license.
illustrate/ˈɪləstreɪt/说明；插图/The teacher used a diagram to illustrate the point.
image/ˈɪmɪdʒ/形象；图像/The company is trying to improve its public image.
imagine/ɪˈmædʒɪn/想象/Can you imagine living on Mars?
imitate/ˈɪmɪteɪt/模仿/Children often imitate their parents.
immediate/ɪˈmiːdiət/立即的/We need to take immediate action.
immense/ɪˈmens/巨大的/The project requires an immense amount of work.
impact/ˈɪmpækt/影响/Climate change has a significant impact on agriculture.
import/ɪmˈpɔːrt/进口/The country imports oil from the Middle East.
impose/ɪmˈpoʊz/强加；征税/The government imposed a tax on luxury goods.
